  "body": "Positioned in a peaceful, family-friendly cul-de-sac, this exceptional residence delivers an impressive combination of space, sophistication and serenity.\r\n\r\nExpansive views across native bush, Long Bay provide a spectacular backdrop, while the home’s generous proportions and multiple living areas create an outstanding environment for both relaxed family life and elegant entertaining.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home, the stylish designer kitchen is beautifully appointed with double ovens, feature lighting and an impressive butler’s pantry, complete with an additional oven and gas hob. The open-plan living and dining area flows effortlessly to an expansive outdoor deck, where panoramic coastal and bush views set the scene for memorable gatherings.\r\n\r\nA separate family lounge with a cosy fireplace offers a warm and inviting retreat, while the upstairs bar and third living area provide another sophisticated space to relax and entertain. A striking chandelier adds a further touch of elegance to the home’s refined interior.\r\nThe luxurious master suite is a private sanctuary, featuring an expansive walk-in wardrobe with feature lighting and a beautifully appointed ensuite. The remaining bedrooms are equally generous, providing excellent accommodation for families and guests.\r\n\r\nProperty highlights include:\r\n•Expansive bush views, peaceful position adjoining a beautiful reserve\r\n•Generous open-plan living and dining\r\n•Designer kitchen with double ovens and feature lighting\r\n•Butler’s pantry with an additional oven and gas hob\r\n•Three spacious living areas\r\n•Upstairs bar and entertaining area\r\n•Family lounge with a cosy fireplace\r\n•Private balcony overlooking the reserve\r\n•Luxurious master suite with a large walk-in wardrobe\r\n•Fully tiled bathrooms with marble vanities, a statement bathtub and smart toilets\r\n•Generously proportioned, luxurious bedrooms\r\n•Striking chandelier and elegant design features\r\n•Double internal-access garage\r\n\r\nFamilies will also appreciate zoning for highly regarded schools, including Long Bay Primary School, Northcross Intermediate and Long Bay College.\r\n\r\nPositioned in one of Auckland’s most desirable coastal communities, the property is close to Long Bay Beach, Long Bay Regional Park and the cafes, restaurants and everyday conveniences of Long Bay Village. Albany’s shopping and business precincts, motorway connections, Massey University and prestigious private schools, including Kristin and Pinehurst, are also within easy reach.",
